# Tasks: Sanity CMS to PayloadCMS Migration

**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-sanity-payload-migration/`
**Prerequisites**: plan.md, spec.md, research.md, data-model.md, contracts/, quickstart.md

**Tests**: Tests are NOT explicitly requested in the specification, so test tasks are excluded per constitution guidelines.

**Organization**: Tasks are grouped by user story to enable independent implementation and testing of each story.

## Format: `[ID] [P?] [Story] Description`

- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)
- **[Story]**: Which user story this task belongs to (e.g., US1, US2, US3)
- Include exact file paths in descriptions

## Path Conventions

This project uses a web application structure:
- PayloadCMS backend: `payload/`, `migration/`, root-level `server.ts`, `payload.config.ts`
- Next.js frontend: `frontend/src/`
- Shared utilities: `utils/`, `config/`, `types/`

