- [X] T018 [P] [US1] Create AffiliatePartner collection in payload/collections/AffiliatePartner.ts with partner fields per data-model.md (name, contactEmail, website, trackingUrlTemplate, commissionRate, commissionType, paymentTerms, status, totalImpressions, totalClicks, conversionRate, onboardedAt, lastPayoutAt, notes)

