## Phase 4: User Story 2 - Data Migration from Sanity to PayloadCMS (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: Export all existing Sanity content, transform to PayloadCMS format, import to MongoDB Atlas with complete data integrity

**Independent Test**: Run migration scripts against production Sanity data, compare record counts, verify relationships preserved, check calculated fields correct

### Migration Script Setup

- [X] T043 [P] [US2] Create export script migration/export-from-sanity.ts with Sanity client initialization and GROQ queries
- [X] T044 [P] [US2] Create transformation script migration/transform-data.ts with field mapping logic per research.md section 5
- [X] T045 [P] [US2] Create import script migration/import-to-payloadcms.ts with PayloadCMS local API and ID mapping
- [X] T046 [P] [US2] Create verification script migration/verify-migration.ts with record count and relationship validation

